# Operator launch checklist (human, not code)

If this session is about **public HTTPS, M5, PythonAnywhere, or real 13+ users**, open `docs/OPERATOR_LAUNCH.md` and walk David through it before treating launch as done.

If this session is product work (real-world questions, UI, engagement, S1 code that is not a live deploy), **do not** interrupt to do ICO/privacy-inbox tasks unless he asks.

Do not invent a calendar ping. The reminder is this rule plus the handoff note in `docs/AI_HANDOFF.md` §7.
